 Agent), its kind, its Access label (a preset name as written, or Custom), its key count, and its active Tokens and sessions.","The key count opens the key checklist of that member; the row menu offers Edit access, Create token, Sign-in link (people only) and Remove.","The header names the roster by its hint and Workspace root and says the roster lives on this host, never in the Workspace or Git; Add member opens the editor.","Tokens lists the active Tokens (never the secret) with their expiry and when each was last used; Revoke ends one. Sessions lists the signed-in browsers, marks the current one and ends any.","Notices above the table: rejected /mcp attempts with a shortcut to create an Agent Token, permission keys no person holds, and a refusal to administer the roster on an address that does not serve it."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"}],"requirements":["01a11485-eb86-7a69-bf1b-70d492ee3be4","01a11c09-ba13-71f1-8194-898b221f6c8a","01a11485-eb6b-724e-b1cc-3f2bc59367e4","01a11c09-c86b-7526-a517-6220b027387a","01a11c09-c8db-7236-87a1-5720487c486a","01a11c09-c94c-77f1-b8e0-b9594584c193","01a11485-ec7b-725c-bcc9-e7c6c7cefc11","01a11485-ed31-7151-ba49-afe20baa376e"]},"variants":{"admin-origin-refused":{"requirements":["01a12500-b105-7773-822f-359d4dcbd1da"],"state":{"add-member":{"visible":false},"admin-origin":{"visible":true},"m-ci-reviewer":{"visible":false},"m-claude":{"visible":false},"m-dana":{"visible":false},"m-jun":{"visible":false},"m-meilin":{"visible":false}}},"key-gap":{"requirements":["01a11c33-24ab-76c8-8811-13d938153cad"],"state":{"m-dana-gap":{"visible":true}}},"load-error":{"state":{"load-error":{"visible":true},"m-ci-reviewer":{"visible":false},"m-claude":{"visible":false},"m-dana":{"visible":false},"m-jun":{"visible":false},"m-meilin":{"visible":false}}},"loading":